{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And from when.</b> From the day that you spoke to him, then he made their yoke heavier, as is written: ויצו פרעה ביום ההוא (Exodus 5:6)." "And the meaning: \"and you have not delivered\" — for I thought that Pharaoh would begin to lighten their burden and you would begin to deliver them." "And the word הרע in \"to this people\" is a verb in the active voice (יוצא), like \"they did worse than their fathers\" (Jeremiah 7:26)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:01.064844272Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}